<section class="section panel authority-proof" id="authority-proof">
<p class="eyebrow">Authority proof</p>
<h2>A published body of work, not a marketing claim.</h2>
<p>Trust is built through visible work, not inflated adoption claims. This site shows the public layer of a wider authorial and technical corpus: published books, public written products, protected rights boundaries and formal institutional-access channels.</p>
<div class="authority-proof-grid">
<div class="authority-proof-card"><strong>Published technical books</strong><span>Amazon-listed technical works on procurement governance, supply sovereignty, decision integrity, evidence and executive defensibility.</span></div>
<div class="authority-proof-card"><strong>Public product catalogue</strong><span>Briefings, tests, notes, bundles and written reviews organised by supplier exposure, contracts, board consequence, technology dependency and decision pressure.</span></div>
<div class="authority-proof-card"><strong>Protected discipline</strong><span>Sovereign Decision Science™ and the Ferreira Doctrine™ are presented as proprietary disciplines with public access separated from licensed institutional use.</span></div>
<div class="authority-proof-card"><strong>Custody and rights boundary</strong><span>SHA-256 custody reference, dedicated rights section and separate contact channels for general contact, licensing and intellectual-property matters.</span></div>
</div>
<p class="small-note">No clients, sales, downloads, institutional adoption or testimonials are claimed here unless expressly and verifiably published.</p>
</section>

<section class="section panel" id="entry"><p class="eyebrow">Public Layer Entry Route</p><h2 data-i18n="entry.title">Start with public understanding. Move to formal access only when scope is written.</h2><p data-i18n="entry.text">The official route moves from public understanding to books and written products, from products to bundles, from bundles to premium written review, and from serious institutional interest to formal scoping, licensing and protected enterprise capability.</p><div class="cta-row"><a class="btn btn-gold" data-i18n="cta.books" href="#books">View Books</a><a class="btn btn-gold" data-i18n="cta.store" href="#store">View Store</a><a class="btn btn-outline" data-i18n="cta.licensing" href="#licensing">Institutional Access</a></div></section>
<section class="section panel" id="who-for">
<p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="audience.kicker">Who this is for</p>
<h2 data-i18n="audience.title">From early professional awareness to executive decision responsibility.</h2>
<p data-i18n="audience.text">The public layer serves readers from initial awareness to senior accountability. It connects procurement, supply chain, contracts, finance, risk, compliance, audit, operations, ERP/MRP, IT and executive leadership around one question: can the decision be defended when consequence appears?</p>
