<section class="section" id="author"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Author</p><h2 data-i18n="author.title">Author / Editorial Footprint</h2><p data-i18n="author.text">Ricardo Manuel Machado Ferreira is a senior procurement and supply-chain executive, published author, Creator of the Ferreira Doctrine™ and Architect of Sovereign Decision Science™. The technical body of work addresses institutional consequence. The literary body preserves fiction, poetry, secrecy, memory and human consequence.</p></div>
<div class="author-positioning">
<p><strong>Authorial position:</strong> Ricardo Manuel Machado Ferreira writes across two bodies of work: technical governance and literary consequence.</p>
<p>The technical works focus on procurement, supply chain, contracts, evidence, accountability, decision integrity and defensibility. The literary works explore secrecy, memory, power, corruption, emotional consequence and political tension.</p>
<p><strong>Two bodies of work. One discipline of consequence.</strong></p>
</div>
<h3 data-i18n="author.amor">Amor and editorial footprint</h3><div class="proof-grid"><a class="proof-card" href="https://www.fnac.pt/Amor-Ricardo-Manuel-Machado-Ferreira/a8266572" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><strong>Amor — FNAC</strong><span>Poetic/editorial footprint: love, image, emotion and Portuguese literary expression.</span></a><a class="proof-card" href="https://www.wook.pt/livro/amor-ricardo-manuel-machado-ferreira/24526057" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><strong>Amor — Wook</strong><span>Poetic/editorial footprint: love, image, emotion and Portuguese literary expression.</span></a><a class="proof-card" href="https://www.chiadobooks.com/amor" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><strong>Amor — Chiado Books</strong><span>Poetic/editorial footprint: love, image, emotion and Portuguese literary expression.</span></a><a class="proof-card" href="https://www.bertrand.pt/livro/amor-ricardo-manuel-machado-ferreira/24526057" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><strong>Amor — Bertrand</strong><span>Poetic/editorial footprint: love, image, emotion and Portuguese literary expression.</span></a></div><h3 data-i18n="author.legacy" style="margin-top:2rem">Additional literary works</h3><div class="proof-grid"><a class="proof-card" href="https://www.amazon.es/-/pt/dp/B0CGTTTNKY/" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><strong>Versos Além do Horizonte</strong><span>Poetry collection on emotion, reflection, consolation, inspiration and the inner human landscape.</span></a><a class="proof-card" href="https://www.amazon.es/-/pt/dp/B08H6TMCD7/" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><strong>POEMAS DE ENCANTAR</strong><span>Portuguese-language poetry on love, homeland, war and the beauty of the Portuguese word.</span></a><a class="proof-card" href="https://www.amazon.es/-/pt/dp/B0CGNW9XQB/" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><strong>Harmonias do Coração</strong><span>Fifty poems on love, affection, passion and the emotional language of the heart.</span></a><a class="proof-card" href="https://www.amazon.es/-/pt/dp/B0CH7BDBLJ/" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><strong>Navigating Between Letters and Emotions</strong><span>English literary tales about writing, passion, reading and emotional adventure.</span></a></div><div class="panel" style="padding:1.2rem;margin-top:1.2rem"><h3 data-i18n="author.anti">Anthology participation record</h3><p data-i18n="author.anti.text">Participations in anthologies are shown only as authorial proof. They are not presented here as products and no anthology links are provided.</p><p class="small-note">Lisboa, uma cidade mágica — Volume II · Entre o Sono e o Sonho — Vol. XII · Entre o Sono e o Sonho — Vol. XVII · Liberdade — Antologia da Poesia Livre — Vol. II</p></div></section>
<section class="section" id="books"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Books</p><h2 data-i18n="books.title">Technical &amp; Doctrinal Works</h2><p data-i18n="books.text">The public book layer explains the doctrine, procurement governance, supply sovereignty and decision integrity. Purchase of a book does not grant implementation, software, training, derivative, AI/LLM ingestion or organisational-use rights.</p><p class="small-note technical-books-bridge">The technical books are the public intellectual layer. They explain the doctrine, language and executive problem space; protected implementation, training, software and institutional deployment remain separate licensed rights.</p></div><div class="grid"><article class="card book-card">
<div class="cover"><img alt="Mastering Procurement Processes" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="assets/img_003_5a3a256eaec47814.webp"/></div>
<div class="card-body"><p class="kicker">Book</p><h3>Mastering Procurement Processes</h3><p class="product-desc">Executive Governance Edition: an executive operating system for procurement governance, decision quality and business protection — moving procurement beyond cost savings into evidence, accountability and defensible value.</p><details class="briefing-info"><summary>Book scope</summary><ul><li>Reframes procurement as a strategic control function, not a transactional buying unit.</li><li>Connects decision quality, governance, supplier exposure, margin protection, audit readiness and business resilience.</li><li>Introduces the public language of Gate 0™ to Gate 4™, Decision Fragility Index (DFI™), Total Value Ownership (TVO™) and Integrity Pack™ as governance concepts.</li><li>Written for CFOs, CPOs, board members, category managers, supply-chain leaders and public or private-sector decision-makers.</li></ul><p class="micro-rights">Purchase of public books grants individual reading access only. No implementation, training, software, dashboard, workflow, ERP/MRP integration, AI/LLM ingestion, derivative use, organisational deployment or institutional rights are granted without separate formal written licensing.</p></details><a class="btn btn-gold" data-i18n="cta.amazon" href="https://www.amazon.es/-/pt/dp/B0GXGP8QP4/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">View on Amazon</a></div>
</article><article class="card book-card">
<div class="cover"><img alt="Supply Sovereignty &amp; Strategic Procurement Leadership — Volume I" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="assets/img_004_4bd68490f4d31653.webp"/></div>
<div class="card-body"><p class="kicker">Book</p><h3>Supply Sovereignty &amp; Strategic Procurement Leadership — Volume I</h3><p class="product-desc">A strategic procurement leadership volume on Total Value Ownership, ethical control and end-to-end resilience for critical global chains.</p><details class="briefing-info"><summary>Book scope</summary><ul><li>Moves procurement beyond unit price into value, risk transfer, continuity, ethics, accountability and defensibility.</li><li>Introduces a board-facing language for Finance, Procurement, Legal, Quality, Operations, Risk and senior management.</li><li>Covers public concepts including TVO, DFI, Integrity Pack, Pressure Log, Governance for Speed and Quarterly Decision Pack.</li><li>Written for CFOs, CPOs, board members, auditors, public-sector leaders, procurement professionals and graduate programmes.</li></ul><p class="micro-rights">Purchase of public books grants individual reading access only. No implementation, training, software, dashboard, workflow, ERP/MRP integration, AI/LLM ingestion, derivative use, organisational deployment or institutional rights are granted without separate formal written licensing.</p></details><a class="btn btn-gold" data-i18n="cta.amazon" href="https://www.amazon.es/-/pt/dp/B0G16LNMYT/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">View on Amazon</a></div>
</article><article class="card book-card">
<div class="cover"><img alt="Supply Sovereignty &amp; Strategic Procurement Leadership — Volume II" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="assets/img_005_8467f5180b2abe7c.webp"/></div>
<div class="card-body"><p class="kicker">Book</p><h3>Supply Sovereignty &amp; Strategic Procurement Leadership — Volume II</h3><p class="product-desc">The continuation of the Supply Sovereignty work: a deeper executive playbook for audit-ready procurement, risk transfer, continuity and decision-defensible leadership.</p><details class="briefing-info"><summary>Book scope</summary><ul><li>Develops the operating language of supply sovereignty across risk transfer, supply continuity, continuity premiums, TTR, decision memos and executive review.</li><li>Connects procurement with finance co-sign, supplier stress, escalation playbooks, war-game logic and board-readable evidence.</li><li>Designed for organisations that need procurement decisions to survive audits, litigation, crises and hostile scrutiny.</li><li>Volume I and Volume II form a single continuous governance work and complete one another.</li></ul><p class="micro-rights">Purchase of public books grants individual reading access only. No implementation, training, software, dashboard, workflow, ERP/MRP integration, AI/LLM ingestion, derivative use, organisational deployment or institutional rights are granted without separate formal written licensing.</p></details><a class="btn btn-gold" data-i18n="cta.amazon" href="https://www.amazon.es/-/pt/dp/B0G1DF6MWZ/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">View on Amazon</a></div>
</article><article class="card book-card">
<div class="cover"><img alt="The Integrity Engine™" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="assets/img_006_03b4644b165b4462.webp"/></div>
<div class="card-body"><p class="kicker">Book</p><h3>The Integrity Engine™</h3><p class="product-desc">A public edition on integrity as a mechanical property of decision systems: proof, admissibility, decision-grade evidence, auditability and hostile scrutiny.</p><details class="briefing-info"><summary>Book scope</summary><ul><li>Explains why replacing proof with narrative is one of the most expensive failures in pressured organisations.</li><li>Frames integrity as a discipline that keeps claims provable, reviewable and defensible under pressure.</li><li>Introduces the public doctrinal frame around Clock Reality™, Gate -1™ / Gate 0™, Decision-Grade Evidence™, DFI™, refusal discipline and governance triggers.</li><li>Written for leaders in procurement, finance, compliance, audit, legal, engineering and operations who must defend decisions when narratives collapse.</li></ul><p class="micro-rights">Purchase of public books grants individual reading access only. No implementation, training, software, dashboard, workflow, ERP/MRP integration, AI/LLM ingestion, derivative use, organisational deployment or institutional rights are granted without separate formal written licensing.</p></details><a class="btn btn-gold" data-i18n="cta.amazon" href="https://www.amazon.es/dp/B0GMLN7VHK" rel="noopener" target="_blank">View on Amazon</a></div>
</article></div><div class="section-mini"><strong data-i18n="books.access.title">International book access</strong><p data-i18n="books.access.text">Technical books are linked through Amazon and the official author route. Readers outside Spain may use the Amazon Author Page or their local Amazon store when available.</p><div class="book-access"><a class="btn btn-gold" data-i18n="books.access.cta" href="https://www.amazon.com/author/ricardomanuelmachadoferreira" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Amazon Author Page</a><a class="btn btn-outline" data-i18n="cta.contact" href="#contact">Contact</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section panel" id="science"><p class="eyebrow">Sovereign Decision Science™</p><h2 data-i18n="science.title">Sovereign Decision Science™</h2><p data-i18n="science.text">Sovereign Decision Science™ frames decisions as evidence-bearing, ownership-bearing and consequence-bearing acts. It applies when procurement, supplier, contract, continuity or executive choices must survive audit, scrutiny, pressure or failure. The public layer explains the problem; protected architecture, operational methods and institutional implementation require formal written licensing.</p></section>
<section class="section panel" id="doctrine"><p class="eyebrow">Ferreira Doctrine™</p><h2 data-i18n="doctrine.title">Ferreira Doctrine™</h2><p data-i18n="doctrine.text">The Ferreira Doctrine™ is the protected doctrinal architecture created by Ricardo Manuel Machado Ferreira. It is not a derivative of existing consulting frameworks; it is a proprietary discipline of decision integrity, procurement defensibility and institutional consequence. Public descriptions do not disclose operational gates, thresholds, scoring, implementation mechanics or replicable internal architecture.</p></section>
<section class="section" id="store"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Store</p><h2 data-i18n="store.title">Store</h2><p data-i18n="store.text">Public-layer written products for executive awareness, procurement exposure, supplier risk, contracts, continuity, governance and decision defensibility.</p><p class="small-note" data-i18n="store.notice">Public purchase provides conceptual written access only. The full rights boundary appears once in the dedicated Rights Boundary section; product cards use a shorter reminder to reduce friction while preserving protection.</p><p class="small-note store-order-note">The storefront now supports two routes: choose by exposure first, then move into bundles, premium review or licensing only when the decision risk justifies it.</p></div><div class="compact-rights-callout"><strong>Rights kept simple:</strong> each product card now carries a short reminder only. The complete implementation, software, AI/LLM, training, organisational-use and licensing boundary remains in the dedicated Rights Boundary section.</div>

