<section class="section panel" id="licensing"><p class="eyebrow">Institutional Access</p><h2 data-i18n="lic.title">Institutional Access / Licensing</h2><p data-i18n="lic.text">Institutional use starts only by formal written inquiry, written scoping and written quotation. Public access explains the problem. Institutional licensing defines the authorised implementation boundary.</p><div class="cta-row"><a class="btn btn-gold" data-i18n="cta.inquire" href="mailto:licensing@ricardoferreira.ai?subject=Institutional%20Licensing%20Inquiry">Send formal inquiry</a></div><p><a class="email-link" data-i18n="lic.email" href="mailto:licensing@ricardoferreira.ai">licensing@ricardoferreira.ai</a></p></section>
<section class="section panel" id="software"><p class="eyebrow">Software</p><h2 data-i18n="software.title">Protected Enterprise Software Direction</h2><p data-i18n="software.text">Software, ERP/MRP integration layers, dashboards, APIs, workflows and institutional deployment are not public products. They are available only through formal written licensing, scoping, quotation and controlled implementation.</p><div class="list-panel"><div data-i18n="software.item1">ERP/MRP integration pathways</div><div data-i18n="software.item2">Dashboards and controlled views</div><div data-i18n="software.item3">APIs and workflow translation</div><div data-i18n="software.item4">Contract-controlled access boundaries</div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="fiction"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Fiction</p><h2 data-i18n="fiction.title">Fiction &amp; Literary Works</h2><p data-i18n="fiction.text">A separate literary body of thrillers, fiction, secrecy, memory, political tension, emotional consequence and historical resonance. Two bodies of work. One discipline of consequence.</p><p class="small-note fiction-bridge">Technical works examine institutional consequence. Fiction explores human, political, emotional and historical consequence.</p></div><div class="grid"><article class="card product-card">
<div class="cover"><img alt="Project Krasnaya" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="assets/img_008_60529d8f7388edc6.webp"/></div>
<div class="card-body"><p class="kicker">Geopolitical thriller</p><h3>Project Krasnaya</h3><p class="product-desc">A high-concept geopolitical thriller about an invisible weapon, a presidential assassination, disinformation, sovereignty and the race to prevent a new world war.</p><details class="briefing-info"><summary>Story scope</summary><ul><li>Captain Ana Petrova and CIA analyst Mark Fletcher uncover a conspiracy designed to trigger invasion and global escalation.</li><li>Moves from Istanbul to the Ural Mountains through surveillance, betrayal, orbital weapons and political manipulation.</li><li>For readers of geopolitical thrillers, espionage, disinformation, sovereignty conflict and near-future military tension.</li></ul></details><a class="btn btn-gold" data-i18n="cta.amazon" href="https://www.amazon.es/dp/B0FR2YSKMR" rel="noopener" target="_blank">View on Amazon</a></div>
</article><article class="card product-card">
<div class="cover"><img alt="Echoes of the Forgotten Cipher" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="assets/img_007_f2f84d8479bf0fe2.webp"/></div>
<div class="card-body"><p class="kicker">International thriller</p><h3>Echoes of the Forgotten Cipher</h3><p class="product-desc">An international thriller where memory becomes the ultimate weapon and a living code turns identity, truth and loyalty into a battleground.</p><details class="briefing-info"><summary>Story scope</summary><ul><li>Alex Kane and Elena Voss confront secret experiments, awakened glyphs and a technology capable of rewriting identity.</li><li>Connects Cold War shadows, New York, Berlin, Tokyo, Lisbon, betrayal, bloodline secrets and psychological suspense.</li><li>For readers who enjoy espionage, memory, code, action, emotional consequence and high-stakes conspiracy.</li></ul></details><a class="btn btn-gold" data-i18n="cta.amazon" href="https://www.amazon.es/-/pt/dp/B0FTXKQGJP" rel="noopener" target="_blank">View on Amazon</a></div>
</article><article class="card product-card">
<div class="cover"><img alt="Baía dos Segredos" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="assets/img_010_aaf6202a5a1ceeb1.webp"/></div>
<div class="card-body"><p class="kicker">Portuguese thriller</p><h3>Baía dos Segredos</h3><p class="product-desc">Um thriller português sobre Lisboa, uma disquete, o Projeto Quírum, espionagem internacional e uma verdade capaz de dominar o mundo.</p><details class="briefing-info"><summary>Story scope</summary><ul><li>O inspetor João Robalo e a analista Sofia Carneiro entram numa conspiração que liga governos, serviços secretos e poder económico.</li><li>CIA, Mossad, MI6 e FSB orbitam uma arma que não dispara balas: dispara verdades.</li><li>Para leitores de thrillers políticos, espionagem, suspense psicológico, conspirações internacionais e narrativas de alta intensidade.</li></ul></details><a class="btn btn-gold" data-i18n="cta.amazon" href="https://www.amazon.es/dp/B0FR17DD1P" rel="noopener" target="_blank">View on Amazon</a></div>
</article><article class="card product-card">
<div class="cover"><img alt="O Legado da Rosa Silenciosa" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="assets/img_009_7775b9acb3cec550.webp"/></div>
<div class="card-body"><p class="kicker">Portuguese thriller</p><h3>O Legado da Rosa Silenciosa</h3><p class="product-desc">Um thriller português sobre crimes sem rasto, uma rosa branca, poder, corrupção, manipulação e justiça sob pressão.</p><details class="briefing-info"><summary>Story scope</summary><ul><li>O Inspetor Ricardo Almeida e a Subinspetora Sofia Castro investigam uma assinatura impossível: uma rosa branca deixada no silêncio.</li><li>Cada pista revela poder protegido, vítimas escolhidas, crimes perfeitos e uma força sempre um passo à frente.</li><li>Para leitores de suspense, corrupção, controlo, manipulação, política, justiça e fragilidade da verdade.</li></ul></details><a class="btn btn-gold" data-i18n="cta.amazon" href="https://amzn.eu/d/00m9hDLz" rel="noopener" target="_blank">View on Amazon</a></div>
</article></div></section>
