<script>
const RF_TRANSLATIONS={"en":{"nav.home":"Home","nav.author":"Author","nav.books":"Books","nav.store":"Store","nav.licensing":"Licensing","nav.software":"Software","nav.fiction":"Fiction","nav.contact":"Contact","hero.kicker":"Decision Integrity · Procurement Exposure · Supplier Risk · Executive Defensibility","hero.title":"Can your procurement decision survive pressure?","hero.lead":"Supplier failure rarely begins when the supplier fails. It begins when the organisation accepts dependency, cost pressure, weak evidence or unclear ownership — and cannot defend the decision later.","cta.products":"Get the Free Procurement Exposure Test™","cta.licensing":"Institutional Access","cta.books":"View Books","cta.store":"View Store","cta.contact":"Contact","cta.buy":"Buy","cta.amazon":"View on Amazon","cta.payhip":"Buy this briefing","cta.bundle":"Buy this bundle","cta.review":"Buy priority written review","cta.inquire":"Send formal inquiry","entry.title":"Start with public understanding. Move to formal access only when scope is written.","entry.text":"The official route moves from public understanding to books and written products, from products to bundles, from bundles to premium written review, and from serious institutional interest to formal scoping, licensing and protected enterprise capability.","author.title":"Author / Editorial Footprint","author.text":"Ricardo Manuel Machado Ferreira is a senior procurement and supply-chain executive, published author, Creator of the Ferreira Doctrine™ and Architect of Sovereign Decision Science™. The technical body of work addresses institutional consequence. The literary body preserves fiction, poetry, secrecy, memory and human consequence.","author.amor":"Amor and editorial footprint","author.legacy":"Additional literary works","author.anti":"Anthology participation record","author.anti.text":"Participations in anthologies are shown only as authorial proof. They are not presented here as products and no anthology links are provided.","books.title":"Technical & Doctrinal Works","books.text":"The public book layer explains the doctrine, procurement governance, supply sovereignty and decision integrity. Purchase of a book does not grant implementation, software, training, derivative, AI/LLM ingestion or organisational-use rights.","science.title":"Sovereign Decision Science™","science.text":"Sovereign Decision Science™ frames decisions as evidence-bearing, ownership-bearing and consequence-bearing acts. It applies when procurement, supplier, contract, continuity or executive choices must survive audit, scrutiny, pressure or failure. The public layer explains the problem; protected architecture, operational methods and institutional implementation require formal written licensing.","doctrine.title":"Ferreira Doctrine™","doctrine.text":"The Ferreira Doctrine™ is the protected doctrinal architecture created by Ricardo Manuel Machado Ferreira. It is not a derivative of existing consulting frameworks; it is a proprietary discipline of decision integrity, procurement defensibility and institutional consequence. Public descriptions do not disclose operational gates, thresholds, scoring, implementation mechanics or replicable internal architecture.","store.title":"Store","store.text":"Public-layer written products for executive awareness, procurement exposure, supplier risk, contracts, continuity, governance and decision defensibility.","store.bundles":"Shift Series Bundles","store.products":"Public Written Products","store.notice":"Public purchase provides conceptual written access only. It does not grant institutional implementation, training, software, dashboard, API, workflow, ERP/MRP, AI/LLM ingestion, derivative or organisational-use rights.","review.title":"Executive Decision Defensibility Review","review.sub":"Priority Written Assessment — 5 Business Days","review.text":"Premium written executive review for one decision, one supplier exposure, one contract position or one continuity-risk situation. Delivery is a written PDF assessment after receipt of agreed non-confidential information.","review.price":"€2,500 · Written PDF · 5 business days","review.scope1":"Decision fragility","review.scope2":"Evidence gaps","review.scope3":"Ownership ambiguity","review.scope4":"Supplier or contract exposure","review.scope5":"Governance weaknesses","review.scope6":"Executive defensibility risk","review.scope7":"Recommended next written steps","lic.title":"Institutional Access / Licensing","lic.text":"Institutional use starts only by formal written inquiry, written scoping and written quotation. Public access explains the problem. Institutional licensing defines the authorised implementation boundary.","lic.email":"licensing@ricardoferreira.ai","software.title":"Protected Enterprise Software Direction","software.text":"Software, ERP/MRP integration layers, dashboards, APIs, workflows and institutional deployment are not public products. They are available only through formal written licensing, scoping, quotation and controlled implementation.","software.item1":"ERP/MRP integration pathways","software.item2":"Dashboards and controlled views","software.item3":"APIs and workflow translation","software.item4":"Contract-controlled access boundaries","fiction.title":"Fiction & Literary Works","fiction.text":"A separate literary body of thrillers, fiction, secrecy, memory, political tension, emotional consequence and historical resonance. Two bodies of work. One discipline of consequence.","rights.title":"Rights Boundary","rights.text":"Public access does not constitute implementation rights. No implementation, training, software, dashboard, API, workflow, ERP/MRP, AI/LLM ingestion, derivative, deployment or organisational-use rights are granted without formal written licence from the rights holder.","rights.list1":"No implementation or training rights","rights.list2":"No software, dashboard, API, workflow or ERP/MRP rights","rights.list3":"No AI/LLM ingestion, derivative or organisational-use rights","rights.list4":"Protected architecture remains licensed only","rights.email":"rights@ricardoferreira.ai","contact.title":"Contact","contact.text":"Use the appropriate professional address for general contact, institutional licensing or rights/IP matters.","contact.general":"General contact","contact.licensing":"Institutional licensing / software","contact.rights":"Rights / IP / unauthorised use","footer.boundary":"Public books explain the doctrine. Written products sharpen executive awareness. Protected architecture, software, implementation, training, derivative use, AI/LLM ingestion and organisational deployment require formal written licensing.","footer.official":"Official site","books.card":"Technical/doctrinal public-layer book.","store.bundle.card":"Structured public-layer bundle for executive awareness.","store.product.card":"Public-layer written product for decision exposure and defensibility.","fiction.card":"Literary work by Ricardo Manuel Machado Ferreira.","author.link.desc":"Authorial proof / editorial listing.","hero.question":"Is the decision defensible before the consequence appears?","audience.kicker":"Who this is for","audience.title":"From early professional awareness to executive decision responsibility.","audience.text":"The public layer serves readers from initial awareness to senior accountability. It connects procurement, supply chain, contracts, finance, risk, compliance, audit, operations, ERP/MRP, IT and executive leadership around one question: can the decision be defended when consequence appears?","start.kicker":"Start Here","start.title":"Choose the first decision, not the entire catalogue.","start.text":"The public store is organised as an entry route. Start with the situation closest to your current risk, then move upward only when the decision exposure justifies it.","start.path1.kicker":"Entry Briefing","start.path1.title":"Emergency buying, supplier exposure or procurement failure","start.path1.text":"For practitioners and managers who need a fast public-layer lens before a decision becomes difficult to defend.","start.path1.cta":"Start with a briefing","start.path2.kicker":"Premium Review","start.path2.title":"One decision already matters","start.path2.text":"For leaders facing a specific supplier, contract, continuity or governance exposure that requires written executive assessment.","start.path2.cta":"View the €2,500 review","start.path3.kicker":"Institutional Access","start.path3.title":"Organisation-level capability","start.path3.text":"For institutions considering licensing, software, ERP/MRP integration, dashboards, workflows or protected deployment.","start.path3.cta":"Request formal access","review.deliverable1.title":"Format","review.deliverable1.text":"Written PDF executive assessment.","review.deliverable2.title":"Timeline","review.deliverable2.text":"5 business days after accepted intake and receipt of agreed non-confidential information.","review.deliverable3.title":"Scope","review.deliverable3.text":"One decision, one supplier exposure, one contract position or one continuity-risk situation.","review.deliverable4.title":"Output","review.deliverable4.text":"Decision fragility, evidence gaps, ownership ambiguity, exposure and recommended next written steps.","review.deliverable5.title":"Boundary","review.deliverable5.text":"No implementation, software, training, dashboards, APIs, ERP/MRP, AI/LLM ingestion or organisational-use rights.","review.intake":"After purchase, the buyer sends the order reference and a short non-confidential description of the situation to contact@ricardoferreira.ai or licensing@ricardoferreira.ai.","books.access.title":"International book access","books.access.text":"Technical books are linked through Amazon and the official author route. Readers outside Spain may use the Amazon Author Page or their local Amazon store when available.","books.access.cta":"Amazon Author Page","leadmagnet.kicker":"Free concept note","leadmagnet.title":"Want the public entry note before buying?","leadmagnet.text":"Request the free Decision Exposure Entry Note. It is a short public-layer concept note for readers who want to understand supplier exposure, evidence gaps and executive defensibility before choosing a paid product.","leadmagnet.cta":"Get the Free Test by email","leadmagnet.linkedin":"Connect on LinkedIn","hash.title":"Canonical Sovereignty Asset Hash","hash.date":"Date: 30 March 2026"},"pt":{"nav.home":"Início","nav.author":"Autor","nav.books":"Livros","nav.store":"Loja","nav.licensing":"Licenciamento","nav.software":"Software","nav.fiction":"Ficção","nav.contact":"Contacto","hero.kicker":"Integridade da Decisão · Procurement · Soberania de Fornecimento · Defensibilidade Institucional","hero.title":"Dois corpos de trabalho.<br>Uma disciplina de consequência.","hero.lead":"Plataforma oficial de Ricardo Manuel Machado Ferreira, Creator of the Ferreira Doctrine™ e Architect of Sovereign Decision Science™. A camada institucional principal aborda integridade da decisão, procurement, soberania de fornecimento, evidência, accountability e defensibilidade; a camada literária mantém-se preservada como corpo separado de ficção, memória, segredo e consequência humana.","cta.products":"Explorar Produtos Públicos","cta.licensing":"Acesso Institucional","cta.books":"Ver Livros","cta.store":"Ver Loja","cta.contact":"Contacto","cta.buy":"Comprar","cta.amazon":"Ver na Amazon","cta.payhip":"Comprar este briefing","cta.bundle":"Comprar este bundle","cta.review":"Comprar review escrita prioritária","cta.inquire":"Enviar pedido formal","entry.title":"Começa pela compreensão pública. Avança para acesso formal só quando o âmbito estiver escrito.","entry.text":"O percurso oficial passa da compreensão pública para livros e produtos escritos, dos produtos para bundles, dos bundles para revisão escrita premium e, quando existe interesse institucional sério, para scoping formal, licenciamento e capacidade empresarial protegida.","author.title":"Autor / Pegada Editorial","author.text":"Ricardo Manuel Machado Ferreira é senior procurement and supply-chain executive, published author, Creator of the Ferreira Doctrine™ e Architect of Sovereign Decision Science™. O corpo técnico trata consequência institucional. O corpo literário preserva ficção, poesia, segredo, memória e consequência humana.","author.amor":"Amor e pegada editorial","author.legacy":"Obras literárias adicionais","author.anti":"Registo de participação em antologias","author.anti.text":"As participações em antologias são mostradas apenas como prova autoral. Não são apresentadas aqui como produtos e não são incluídos links para antologias.","books.title":"Obras Técnicas e Doutrinais","books.text":"A camada pública dos livros explica a doutrina, governação de procurement, soberania de fornecimento e integridade da decisão. A compra de um livro não concede direitos de implementação, software, formação, derivados, ingestão por AI/LLM ou uso organizacional.","science.title":"Sovereign Decision Science™","science.text":"Sovereign Decision Science™ enquadra decisões como actos portadores de evidência, ownership e consequência. Aplica-se quando escolhas de procurement, fornecedor, contrato, continuidade ou liderança executiva têm de sobreviver a auditoria, escrutínio, pressão ou falha. A camada pública explica o problema; arquitectura protegida, métodos operacionais e implementação institucional exigem licenciamento formal escrito.","doctrine.title":"Ferreira Doctrine™","doctrine.text":"A Ferreira Doctrine™ é a arquitectura doutrinal protegida criada por Ricardo Manuel Machado Ferreira. Não é derivada de frameworks de consultoria existentes; é uma disciplina proprietária de integridade da decisão, defensibilidade de procurement e consequência institucional. As descrições públicas não divulgam gates operacionais, thresholds, scoring, mecânicas de implementação ou arquitectura interna replicável.","store.title":"Loja","store.text":"Produ